## Coverage Requirements

- Maintain minimum 80% line coverage
- Achieve 75%+ branch coverage minimum
- Track coverage trends continuously
- Generate reports automatically
- Validate coverage in CI/CD
- Exclude generated files appropriately
- Monitor coverage per feature

## Coverage Validation Process

- Generate coverage with `flutter test --coverage`
- Report output to @coverage/lcov.info
- Validate thresholds before push
- Track coverage regression prevention
- Monitor coverage trends over time
- Generate HTML reports for analysis
- Integrate with CI/CD pipelines

```bash
# Coverage generation and validation
flutter test --coverage --reporter=expanded
genhtml coverage/lcov.info -o coverage/html
open coverage/html/index.html
```

