## Exclusion Patterns

- Generated files from build_runner
- Auto-generated mock classes
- Platform-specific bridge code
- Third-party library wrappers
- Configuration and constants files
- Development-only utilities
- Mock test data factories

```dart
// Coverage exclusions in test files
// coverage:ignore-start
class GeneratedMockClass extends Mock implements Interface {}
// coverage:ignore-end

// coverage:ignore-line
void debugOnlyMethod() => print('Debug info');
```

