## Automated Coverage Validation

- Run coverage on every test execution
- Validate minimum thresholds automatically
- Generate reports in CI/CD
- Fail builds on coverage drops
- Track coverage metrics over time
- Report coverage to teams
- Integrate with quality dashboards

```bash
# Coverage threshold validation script
COVERAGE_THRESHOLD=80
ACTUAL_COVERAGE=$(grep -o "lines.*: [0-9.]*%" coverage/lcov.info | head -1 | grep -o "[0-9.]*")

if (( $(echo "$ACTUAL_COVERAGE < $COVERAGE_THRESHOLD" | bc -l) )); then
  echo "❌ Coverage $ACTUAL_COVERAGE% below threshold $COVERAGE_THRESHOLD%"
  exit 1
else
  echo "✅ Coverage $ACTUAL_COVERAGE% meets threshold"
fi
```

